    "turn_text": "Too much turmoil, too much drama. uh... all we want to do is really is that a fight for everyday american and not the millionaires or billionaires who are pushing us towards uh... this shutdown uh... shut down to have a huge impact devastating consequences on everyday americans we need to we need to stop it",
