    "turn_text": "Yeah. Well, I called in two subjects real quick. It's been a very short call. So the original bill, there was 1500 pages, approximately give or take a couple pages. That would take me probably we can have to read. I like to read. I can read a 300 page book in about three, four days. OK. And then the new bill that is popped out 100. I heard 100. I read 166 pages. OK. So a little about 10% give or take. And they streamlined it best they could just to get us through the, you know, the next few months.",
