    "turn_idx": 213,
    "turn_text": "it bugs me when people call social security and Medicare for that matter, you know, entitlements. I mean, these are programs that we've all put paid into as workers and they're not, we're not just entitled to them. I mean, we've, you know, they are what they are because of us. I was paying into them, but",
